   ABSTRACT
 - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -

        A four-layer hardened .NET desktop application was fully unpacked
        and its client-side licensing scheme reconstructed from scratch.

        Layer 1  Themida/WinLicense native packer
                 -> in-memory .NET PE reconstruction (COR20 @ RVA 0x2000)

        Layer 2  Method-body virtualization
                 7860 of 13983 MethodDefs replaced by 4-byte stubs
                 -> custom hook installed ABOVE the packer's own
                    ICorJitCompiler::compileMethod vtable hook
                 -> 9632 real method bodies recovered

        Layer 3  String encryption + delegate trampolines
                 -> 858 delegate fields resolved at runtime by reflection

        Layer 4  Authorization core loaded via Assembly.Load(byte[])
                 -> dumped in-process and fully decompiled (728 lines C#)

